      "content": "thanks for saying that. i'm just really busy with work and life right now so i don't really have time for doctor appointments or sitting in waiting rooms if it's not like an emergency. do u think it could just be from the post-flu exhaustion? like maybe if i just take some extra electrolytes and really rest for a few days it'll clear up? feels like it might just be my body catching up.",
